OL,3,AMPs and Lords call for new law to
OL,4,Aaddress AI threat to human rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said AI is
OL,7,F"advancing at an extraordinary pace"
OL,8,Fand is creating both opportunities and
OL,9,Frisks.
